{"version":1,"content":"<p>據Sportico報道，<strong>凱迪拉克F1車隊老闆馬克·沃爾特正在尋求出售這支美國F1車隊，報價30億美元，目前已有7位潛在買方表示興趣。</strong>報道稱，凱迪拉克F1車隊是2026賽季F1唯一的全新車隊，也是自2016年哈斯之後首支加入F1的美國車隊。然而車隊一分未得，目前是唯一零積分的車隊。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584800.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:22:46.223076+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T06:01:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:18:39.799619+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:18:39.799619+00:00","content_hash":"19a4ce59692248d91824819e26b3d4a4efa80b1d4c0fec9480cbb0f46623f2c3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}